export function parseBirthday(value){let m=String(value).trim().match(/^(\d{1,2})[\/-](\d{1,2})(?:[\/-](\d{4}))?$/),month,day;if(m){day=Number(m[1]);month=Number(m[2])}else{m=String(value).trim().match(/^(\d{4})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})$/);if(!m)return null;month=Number(m[2]);day=Number(m[3])}const d=new Date(2000,month-1,day);return d.getMonth()===month-1&&d.getDate()===day?{month,day}:null}
// El 29 de febrero se celebra el 28 en años no bisiestos.
export function nextBirthday(p,reference){const ref=new Date(reference);ref.setHours(0,0,0,0);function inYear(y){const max=new Date(y,p.month,0).getDate();return new Date(y,p.month-1,Math.min(p.day,max))}let next=inYear(ref.getFullYear());if(next<ref)next=inYear(ref.getFullYear()+1);return next}
export function daysUntil(p,reference){const a=nextBirthday(p,reference);return Math.round((Date.UTC(a.getFullYear(),a.getMonth(),a.getDate())-Date.UTC(reference.getFullYear(),reference.getMonth(),reference.getDate()))/86400000)}
export function parseCSV(input){const text=input.replace(/^\uFEFF/,'');const firstLine=text.split(/\r?\n/)[0];const sep=(firstLine.match(/;/g)||[]).length>(firstLine.match(/,/g)||[]).length?';':',';let rows=[],row=[],field='',quoted=false;for(let i=0;i<text.length;i++){const c=text[i];if(c==='"'){if(quoted&&text[i+1]==='"'){field+='"';i++}else quoted=!quoted}else if(c===sep&&!quoted){row.push(field);field=''}else if((c==='\n'||c==='\r')&&!quoted){if(c==='\r'&&text[i+1]==='\n')i++;row.push(field);rows.push(row);row=[];field=''}else field+=c}if(quoted)throw Error('El CSV tiene comillas sin cerrar.');if(field||row.length){row.push(field);rows.push(row)}if(!rows.length)throw Error('El archivo está vacío.');return rows}
export function calendarFile(p,today,options){const date=nextBirthday(p,today),pad=n=>String(n).padStart(2,'0'),stamp=d=>d.getFullYear()+pad(d.getMonth()+1)+pad(d.getDate()),end=new Date(date);end.setDate(end.getDate()+1);const escape=s=>String(s).replace(/\\/g,'\\\\').replace(/\n/g,'\\n').replace(/,/g,'\\,').replace(/;/g,'\\;');const alarms=[];if(options.before)alarms.push('TRIGGER:-P1D');if(options.on)alarms.push('TRIGGER:PT0S');const lines=['BEGIN:VCALENDAR','VERSION:2.0','PRODID:-//Confetti//Cumpleanos//ES','CALSCALE:GREGORIAN','BEGIN:VEVENT','UID:'+encodeURIComponent(p.id)+'-'+date.getFullYear()+'@confetti.local','DTSTAMP:'+new Date().toISOString().replace(/[-:]/g,'').replace(/\.\d{3}/,''),'DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:'+stamp(date),'DTEND;VALUE=DATE:'+stamp(end),'RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH='+p.month+';BYMONTHDAY='+p.day,'SUMMARY:'+escape('🎉 Cumpleaños de '+p.name),'DESCRIPTION:'+escape('Recordá saludar a '+p.name+(p.email?'. Correo: '+p.email:'')),...alarms.flatMap(trigger=>['BEGIN:VALARM',trigger,'ACTION:DISPLAY','DESCRIPTION:Recordatorio de cumpleaños','END:VALARM']),'END:VEVENT','END:VCALENDAR'];if(p.month===2&&p.day===29){const idx=lines.findIndex(l=>l.startsWith('RRULE:'));lines[idx]='RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=2;BYMONTHDAY=28,29;BYSETPOS=-1'}const encoder=new TextEncoder();return lines.map(line=>{let chunks=[],part='',len=0;for(const ch of line){const n=encoder.encode(ch).length;if(len+n>73){chunks.push(part);part=' ';len=1}part+=ch;len+=n}chunks.push(part);return chunks.join('\r\n')}).join('\r\n')+'\r\n'}

export function validatePerson(p,label='Esta persona'){
 if(!p||typeof p.name!=='string'||!p.name.trim()||p.name.length>200)throw Error(label+': completá un nombre válido (máximo 200 caracteres).');
 if(!Number.isInteger(p.day)||!Number.isInteger(p.month)||!parseBirthday(p.day+'/'+p.month))throw Error(label+': elegí un día y mes válidos.');
 if(p.email&&(!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(p.email)||p.email.length>254))throw Error(label+': revisá el correo electrónico.');
 if(p.id!==undefined&&(typeof p.id!=='string'||p.id.length>300))throw Error(label+': identificador inválido.');
}
function personKey(p){return p.name.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').trim().toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,' ')+'|'+p.month+'|'+p.day}
export function mergePeople(base,local){const list=base.map(p=>({...p}));for(const p of local){const index=list.findIndex(x=>x.id===p.id||personKey(x)===personKey(p));if(index>=0)list[index]={...list[index],...p,id:list[index].id};else list.push({...p})}return list}
export function publicPeople(people,{includeEmail=false}={}){const used=new Set(people.filter(p=>/^person-\d+$/.test(p.id)).map(p=>p.id));let next=1;return people.map(p=>{let id=p.id;if(!/^person-\d+$/.test(id)){do{id='person-'+String(next++).padStart(3,'0')}while(used.has(id));used.add(id)}return {id,name:p.name.trim(),day:p.day,month:p.month,...(includeEmail&&p.email?{email:p.email.trim().toLowerCase()}:{})}})}
